  "content": "<h3><strong>這是針對 ewewukek 的&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmusket-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">火槍模組</a>&nbsp;的資源包</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>此資源包是 Scarecrow01 的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/flintl0cks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flinkl0cks 資源包</a>&nbsp;的延續，大部分功勞歸於他！</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>**重要：如果您希望顯示下方影片中的閒置姿勢，請務必在火槍模組的設定中禁用「第三人稱始終瞄準」選項</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1114702/description_b695e774-3f17-4618-a414-9ac2c9d4dd57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"57\"></strong></p>\n<h1>Scarecrow 的原始模型/紋理，並進行了些許調整。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a1277c3c-417d-44d8-90b9-961688704c9f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bddf0513-cbbb-4cd9-99bb-feebfca738ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f160ccce-00d9-4695-9c72-4974dffa7de8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<h1>新增了短管獵槍（blunderbuss）的模型/紋理。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9cf596e4-45ab-4f2c-92a7-a1dfbb3f582a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<h1>新增了帶瞄準鏡的火槍模型/紋理。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_676cd68a-7336-4e8d-9fc3-920fd03d8b96.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<h2>重新設計了第三人稱持槍姿勢：</h2>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tMO5ro1nGAg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>禁用</strong></span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> 火槍模組設定中的此選項，否則您將無法看到影片中顯示的閒置姿勢</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1114702/description_01de1262-c2e3-4ca1-91b8-925dff342bd6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"57\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8391a159-3aa6-43d5-88d9-eedfeb6d3e64.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">:D</p>",
